Description:You are at 2 life. The opponent's Youthful Knight (2/1 first strike) and Grizzly Bears (2/2) are attacking you. You control Typhoid Rats (1/1 deathtouch) and Horned Turtle (1/4). End the turn with no creatures on the opponent's battlefield.
Rule:authored-first-strike-deathtouch | Only first strikers deal damage in the first-strike combat damage step (CR 510.4, 702.7b), and a blocker destroyed there deals no damage (CR 510.1d): Typhoid Rats blocking the Knight dies before its deathtouch matters, so the Turtle must block the Knight and the Rats the Bears
